  "notes": "VidBee web UI. Honey/amber brand (bee logo) used for Add URL pill, active nav tile tint, progress bars (amber fill over pale amber track), spinner and pause icons. Rows are ~72px with 16:9 thumbnails (generated gradient title cards), tiny brand-coloured platform glyph before title, status line with spinner/pause icon. Error rows expand with red error text and small outlined 'Report this error: View logs | FAQ | GitHub | Email feedback' pills, plus retry/copy actions. Row actions (copy path, pause/resume, cancel; download/copy for completed) are borderless round icon buttons, partly hover-revealed. Untranslated i18n key 'history.cookiesTipAction' visible on banner button."
